# =============================================================================
# Env is loaded from the PROJECT ROOT, not from this folder.
# =============================================================================
#
# Copy the root .env.example to the project root as .env, then create
# .env.local (for APP_ENV=local) and/or .env.production (for APP_ENV=production)
# in the project root.
#
# See: ../../.env.example
#      ../../.env.local.example
#      ../../.env.production.example
#
# You can remove .env, .env.local, .env.production from this folder - they
# are no longer used. Laravel bootstrap loads from root.
# =============================================================================
